### ✅ ステップ8：Athena設定

Glue Data CatalogにParquetテーブルを作成。以下のDDLを実行：

```sql
CREATE EXTERNAL TABLE mhealth (
  id string,
  timestamp timestamp,
  accel_x double,
  accel_y double,
  accel_z double
)
STORED AS PARQUET
LOCATION 's3://aws-data-platform-20250607/processed/';
```

